blob-free build

Remove the closed binaries from the tree, per THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES. This patch carries the text changes only. The binary files themselves are deleted by remove-blobs.sh, so no copy of them lives in this repo. The files are redirect.tzst (libredirect.so, libredirect-bionic.so), the modern-flavor
libredirect-bionic-wx*.so, jniLibs libkgslshim.so and libsteambootstrap.so,
and the Samsung Performance SDK jar with SamsungPerformanceDriver.kt, the
PowerManager Samsung branch, the gradle dependency and the proguard lines.

Keep the app working without them:
- ImageFsInstaller: a missing redirect.tzst is logged and the install
  continues, so extras.tzst still lands in imagefs.
- BionicProgramLauncherComponent: the libredirect preload resolver returns
  null when the file is not on disk, so no LD_PRELOAD entry points at a
  missing library; Faster external loading is skipped without libredirect.
- GeneralTab: hide Disable libredirect; Faster external loading is shown
  off and disabled.
- THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES: dated note at the top listing what was removed.

libkgslshim (XR only) and libsteambootstrap (real-Steam mode only) were
already guarded by exists() checks. Only the legacy flavor is supported.


